## 3.10. Representations of tensor products
%%%
tag := "Chapter3/Introduction_to_3.10/heading-1"
%%%

Let $`A, B` be algebras. Then $`A \otimes B` is also an algebra, with multiplication $`(a_1 \otimes b_1)(a_2 \otimes b_2) = a_1 a_2 \otimes b_1 b_2`.

